<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="http-run-code">
  <title>Print a greeting</title>
  <body>
    <p>Run this JavaScript with Node.js:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-javascript">console.log("Hello from JavaScript");</codeblock>
    <p>Run the same greeting in Python:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-python">print("Hello from Python")</codeblock>
    <p>Or in Bash:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-bash">echo "Hello from Bash"</codeblock>
    <p>To install the greeter for every project on your machine, run:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-bash">npm install --global ./greeter</codeblock>
  </body>
</topic>
